Calculate confidence using:

- Data completeness.
- Data freshness.
- Source agreement.
- Signal consistency.
- Financial statement availability.
- News verification.
- Historical strategy reliability.

A company can have excellent financial quality but a low-confidence trading signal.

The system must recognize this difference.

